{"seq":1,"slug":"core-mechanics","title":"核心机制设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/core-mechanics","wordCount":1906,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"核心机制设计\">核心机制设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>游戏核心机制（Core Mechanics）是构成游戏玩法的基本规则和交互单元，它定义了玩家可以执行的动作、动作产生的结果以及系统如何响应玩家输入。核心机制是游戏设计的骨架，所有的关卡、叙事和经济系统都建立在其之上。理解核心机制不仅需要掌握其形式化定义，还要深入理解&quot;动词设计&quot;——即玩家在游戏中能做什么。</p>\n<p>一个完整的核心机制包含三个层面：输入层（玩家操作）、处理层（规则引擎）和输出层（反馈呈现）。设计者需要确保这三层形成紧密的闭环，使玩家在每次交互中都能感受到清晰的因果关系。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[玩家输入] --&gt; B{规则引擎}&#10;    B --&gt; C[状态变更]&#10;    C --&gt; D[反馈呈现]&#10;    D --&gt; E[玩家感知]&#10;    E --&gt; A&#10;    B --&gt; F[约束条件]&#10;    F --&gt; B&#10;    subgraph 核心循环&#10;        A&#10;        B&#10;        C&#10;        D&#10;        E&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    A[玩家输入] --&gt; B{规则引擎}\n    B --&gt; C[状态变更]\n    C --&gt; D[反馈呈现]\n    D --&gt; E[玩家感知]\n    E --&gt; A\n    B --&gt; F[约束条件]\n    F --&gt; B\n    subgraph 核心循环\n        A\n        B\n        C\n        D\n        E\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制类型</th>\n<th>代表游戏</th>\n<th>核心动词</th>\n<th>涌现复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回合制策略</td>\n<td>文明系列</td>\n<td>建造、研究、外交</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>即时动作</td>\n<td>黑暗之魂</td>\n<td>攻击、闪避、格挡</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解谜平台</td>\n<td>传送门</td>\n<td>放置传送门、跳跃</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>卡牌构筑</td>\n<td>杀戮尖塔</td>\n<td>出牌、升级、选路</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>沙盒建造</td>\n<td>我的世界</td>\n<td>挖掘、放置、合成</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>核心机制的质量评估可以从四个维度展开：可学习性（新手能否快速上手）、深度（是否支持高阶策略）、清晰度（规则是否直觉可懂）和趣味性（操作本身是否令人愉悦）。优秀的核心机制往往&quot;一分钟学会，一辈子精通&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"动词设计与交互原语\">动词设计与交互原语</h2><p>游戏设计的本质是设计&quot;动词&quot;——玩家在游戏世界中可执行的操作。每个动词都是一个交互原语，多个原语的组合产生丰富的玩法涌现。</p>\n<p>动词设计遵循&quot;少即是多&quot;原则。以经典平台跳跃游戏为例，仅靠&quot;移动&quot;和&quot;跳跃&quot;两个动词就能衍生出数百种关卡挑战。关键在于每个动词之间能否产生有意义的组合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface GameVerb {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  inputType: &#39;discrete&#39; | &#39;continuous&#39; | &#39;contextual&#39;;&#10;  targetTypes: string[];&#10;  cooldown: number;&#10;  canCombineWith: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface MechanicsSystem {&#10;  verbs: Map&lt;string, GameVerb&gt;;&#10;  evaluate(input: PlayerInput): ActionResult;&#10;  getAvailableActions(context: GameContext): GameVerb[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const platformerVerbs: GameVerb[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;jump&#39;,&#10;    inputType: &#39;discrete&#39;,&#10;    targetTypes: [&#39;platform&#39;, &#39;enemy&#39;, &#39;item&#39;],&#10;    cooldown: 0,&#10;    canCombineWith: [&#39;move&#39;, &#39;dash&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    name: &#39;dash&#39;,&#10;    inputType: &#39;discrete&#39;,&#10;    targetTypes: [&#39;direction&#39;],&#10;    cooldown: 500,&#10;    canCombineWith: [&#39;jump&#39;, &#39;attack&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GameVerb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  inputType</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'discrete'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'continuous'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'contextual'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  targetTypes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  cooldown</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  canCombineWith</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MechanicsSystem</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  verbs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">GameVerb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">input</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PlayerInput</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ActionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getAvailableActions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GameContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GameVerb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> platformerVerbs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GameVerb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'jump'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discrete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targetTypes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'platform'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'enemy'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'item'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cooldown: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    canCombineWith: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'move'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'dash'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    inputType: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'discrete'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    targetTypes: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'direction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    cooldown: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    canCombineWith: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'jump'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'attack'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p>动词设计的层次可以分为三级。<strong>基础动词</strong>是最原子的操作，如移动、跳跃和攻击。<strong>组合动词</strong>是基础动词的串联，如跳斩（跳跃+攻击）、冲刺跳（冲刺+跳跃）。<strong>情境动词</strong>依赖特定上下文触发，如在墙面时的蹬墙跳、在特定地形上的滑行。</p>\n<p>设计者需要绘制&quot;动词矩阵&quot;来检验动词之间的交互覆盖度：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>移动</th>\n<th>跳跃</th>\n<th>攻击</th>\n<th>冲刺</th>\n<th>格挡</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>移动</strong></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>方向跳</td>\n<td>移动攻击</td>\n<td>冲刺移动</td>\n<td>移动格挡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>跳跃</strong></td>\n<td>空中移动</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>跳斩</td>\n<td>空中冲刺</td>\n<td>空中格挡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>攻击</strong></td>\n<td>突进斩</td>\n<td>上挑</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>冲刺斩</td>\n<td>反击</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>冲刺</strong></td>\n<td>闪步</td>\n<td>冲刺跳</td>\n<td>冲刺攻击</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>弹反</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>格挡</strong></td>\n<td>盾步</td>\n<td>弹跳防御</td>\n<td>盾击</td>\n<td>完美闪避</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵中空白区域意味着设计机会——可以通过填充这些组合来增加游戏深度，但也需要权衡实现成本和认知负荷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与规则系统\">状态机与规则系统</h2><p>游戏的核心机制在技术层面通常以状态机（State Machine）的形式实现。有限状态机（FSM）和层级状态机（HFSM）是最常见的两种模式，它们清晰地定义了游戏实体在不同状态间的转换规则。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Idle&#10;    Idle --&gt; Running : 移动输入&#10;    Running --&gt; Idle : 释放移动&#10;    Running --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入&#10;    Idle --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入&#10;    Jumping --&gt; Falling : 到达顶点&#10;    Falling --&gt; Idle : 着地&#10;    Falling --&gt; WallSliding : 接触墙面&#10;    WallSliding --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入&#10;    WallSliding --&gt; Falling : 离开墙面&#10;    Idle --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入&#10;    Running --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入&#10;    Attacking --&gt; Idle : 动画结束&#10;    Jumping --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Idle\n    Idle --&gt; Running : 移动输入\n    Running --&gt; Idle : 释放移动\n    Running --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入\n    Idle --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入\n    Jumping --&gt; Falling : 到达顶点\n    Falling --&gt; Idle : 着地\n    Falling --&gt; WallSliding : 接触墙面\n    WallSliding --&gt; Jumping : 跳跃输入\n    WallSliding --&gt; Falling : 离开墙面\n    Idle --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入\n    Running --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入\n    Attacking --&gt; Idle : 动画结束\n    Jumping --&gt; Attacking : 攻击输入</pre><p>规则系统的设计需要处理状态优先级和中断机制。在动作游戏中，某些状态（如受击）应当能够中断大多数其他状态，而某些状态（如无敌帧）则不可被中断：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface StateConfig {&#10;  name: string;&#10;  priority: number;&#10;  interruptible: boolean;&#10;  allowedTransitions: string[];&#10;  onEnter: (context: EntityContext) =&gt; void;&#10;  onUpdate: (context: EntityContext, dt: number) =&gt; void;&#10;  onExit: (context: EntityContext) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;class HierarchicalStateMachine {&#10;  private states: Map&lt;string, StateConfig&gt;;&#10;  private currentState: string;&#10;  private stateStack: string[];&#10;&#10;  transition(targetState: string, context: EntityContext): boolean {&#10;    const current = this.states.get(this.currentState)!;&#10;    const target = this.states.get(targetState)!;&#10;&#10;    if (!current.allowedTransitions.includes(targetState)) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if (!current.interruptible &amp;&amp; target.priority &lt;= current.priority) {&#10;      return false;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    current.onExit(context);&#10;    this.currentState = targetState;&#10;    target.onEnter(context);&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> StateConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  priority</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  interruptible</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  allowedTransitions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onEnter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onUpdate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  onExit</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">context</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> EntityContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shi