=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity.jumpForce </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> calculateJumpForce</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.jump.height, config.jump.duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity.gravityScale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.jump.gravity;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity.dashSpeed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.dash.distance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.dash.duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity.attackData </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    light: { damage: config.combat.lightAttackDamage },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heavy: { damage: config.combat.heavyAttackDamage },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键参数如&quot;土狼时间&quot;（Coyote Time，离开平台边缘后仍可跳跃的容错窗口）和&quot;输入缓冲&quot;（Buffer Time，提前输入的指令在合法时机自动执行）直接影响操作手感。这些参数通常需要数十轮迭代才能找到最优值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((核心机制设计))&#10;    动词设计&#10;      基础动词&#10;      组合动词&#10;      情境动词&#10;      动词矩阵&#10;    状态机&#10;      有限状态机&#10;      层级状态机&#10;      优先级与中断&#10;    涌现性&#10;      数据耦合&#10;      事件耦合&#10;      规则耦合&#10;      耦合平衡&#10;    原型验证&#10;      纸面原型&#10;      数字灰盒&#10;      参数调优&#10;      手感打磨\">mindmap\n  root((核心机制设计))\n    动词设计\n      基础动词\n      组合动词\n      情境动词\n      动词矩阵\n    状态机\n      有限状态机\n      层级状态机\n      优先级与中断\n    涌现性\n      数据耦合\n      事件耦合\n      规则耦合\n      耦合平衡\n    原型验证\n      纸面原型\n      数字灰盒\n      参数调优\n      手感打磨</pre><ul>\n<li>核心机制是游戏的骨架，由输入、规则引擎和反馈呈现构成闭环</li>\n<li>动词设计遵循&quot;少即是多&quot;原则，通过动词矩阵检验交互覆盖度</li>\n<li>状态机是机制实现的技术基础，层级状态机可有效减少状态爆炸</li>\n<li>涌现性来自系统间的有意耦合，追求低设计复杂度与高涌现复杂度的比值</li>\n<li>核心机制需要通过纸面原型、数字灰盒和参数调优三阶段迭代打磨</li>\n<li>&quot;土狼时间&quot;和&quot;输入缓冲&quot;等细节参数对操作手感至关重要</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"核心机制设计","id":"核心机制设计"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"动词设计与交互原语","id":"动词设计与交互原语"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与规则系统","id":"状态机与规则系统"},{"level":2,"text":"涌现性与系统耦合","id":"涌现性与系统耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"迭代与原型验证","id":"迭代与原型验证"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"玩家体验与心流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-design/game-design-fundamentals/player-experience"}}